<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj employment fell 0.5 pct in Dec quarter. [CORRECTED 22:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj employment fell 0.5 pct in Dec quarter. [CORRECTED 22:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to show that employment fell 0.5 pct rather than rose 5.9 pct.)</p>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday issued the following provisional, seasonally-adjusted data for December quarter employment and unemployment.</p>
<p>Figures are based on standard international definitions with &quot;revised from&quot; figures in brackets.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			 Dec qtr 96    Sep qtr 96	  Dec qtr 95</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Unemployment	   5.9 pct	6.3 pct	     6.2 pct</p>
</text>
